  "termsLicenceTitle": "Licence to use the app",
  "termsLicenceBody": "ClaudySoft grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable and revocable licence to use Flash Light Pro on devices you own or control. You may not copy, resell, redistribute, modify, reverse engineer or attempt to extract the source code, except where the law expressly allows it.",
  "termsAdsTitle": "Ads and Remove ads",
  "termsAdsBody": "The free version is supported by Google AdMob ads, shown only after the consent required in your region. An optional one-time, non-consumable purchase removes all ads. Payments and refunds are handled by Google Play or the App Store; the app never receives your payment details. You can restore the purchase from Settings.",
  "termsSafetyTitle": "Safety",
  "termsSafetyBody": "Flash Light Pro is a convenience tool, not safety or emergency equipment. SOS, strobe and Morse only produce light; they do not call emergency services or share your location. Strobe can trigger seizures in people with photosensitivity. Do not use the light while driving or in any situation where distraction is dangerous, and do not shine it into eyes, at vehicles or at aircraft. Long use can drain the battery and heat the device, and background operation is not guaranteed by the operating system.",
  "termsUseTitle": "Acceptable use",
  "termsUseBody": "Use the app only for lawful purposes. Do not use it to impersonate emergency services, harass or endanger anyone, distract drivers, or break road, aviation or public-order rules.",
  "termsPermissionsTitle": "Permissions and privacy",
  "termsPermissionsBody": "The app uses the camera flash, screen brightness, optional haptics and, only when Shake to toggle is on, the motion sensor. It does not request camera, microphone, location, contacts or file access. See the Privacy policy in Settings for how data is handled.",
  "termsUpdatesTitle": "Availability and updates",
  "termsUpdatesBody": "The core light modes work offline. Features may change, be removed or be unavailable on some devices, and updates may be required. We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation.",
