  "termsLiabilityBody": "The app is provided \"as is\" and \"as available\", to the maximum extent permitted by law. We are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, and our total liability is limited to the greater of the amount you paid for the app in the last twelve months or USD 5. Nothing here limits rights that the law does not allow to be excluded.",
